stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Closed
  Closed --> Editing: Open current recorded reason and evidence
  Closed --> Closed: New recorded card arrives
  Editing --> Editing: Type or receive background update
  Editing --> Closed: Close and discard draft
  Editing --> Sending: Save reviewed draft
  Sending --> Closed: Confirmation and canonical readback
  Sending --> Conflict: Card changed
  Conflict --> Editing: Refresh card and review kept draft
  Conflict --> Conflict: Refresh unavailable
  Sending --> Uncertain: Reply or readback unavailable
  Uncertain --> Sending: Retry identical request
  Uncertain --> Uncertain: Opposing changes stay disabled
  Editing --> Retired: Card completed
  Closed --> Disposed: Unmount
  Editing --> Disposed: Unmount
  Sending --> Disposed: Unmount
  Disposed --> [*]
  %% never Replace an active draft during background refresh.
  %% never Reuse old text with a fresh base when opening a closed editor.
  %% never Change an unresolved request during recovery.

  state "Proof runner" as Proof {
    [*] --> Fetching
    Fetching --> Compiling: Release available
    Compiling --> Launching: Fixture ready
    Launching --> Observing: Browser ready
    Observing --> Cleaned: Assertions finish or fail
    Fetching --> Cancelling: Deadline
    Compiling --> Cancelling: Deadline
    Launching --> Cancelling: Deadline
    Observing --> Cancelling: Deadline
    Cancelling --> Cleaned: Worker disposes compiler and browser
    Cleaned --> [*]
  }
  %% never Advance proof startup after cancellation.
  %% never Return from proof while its worker still owns a browser.
